{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06961","headline":"从军行 · 杜頠","name":"从军行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋草马蹄轻，角弓持弦急。\n去爲龙城候，正值胡兵袭。\n军气横大荒，战酣日将入。\n长风金鼓动，白露铁衣湿。\n四起愁边声，南辕时伫立。\n断蓬孤自转，寒雁飞相及。\n万里云沙涨，平川冰霰溢。\n夜闻汉使归，独向刀环泣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜頠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}